(4332291, 624952, 66201, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image for the challenge topic- I like the way the shadow is captured on the railings... creates this sort of Y shape. I think this might have had even more impact in a larger size - appears a bit small on the page. Windmills make good Perspective/Leading Lines subjects :-)  I may have come in closer under the windmill to try and get it to loom above me more - but I would not have sacrificed the shadow effect.</td>', 'This is a striking image for the challenge topic- I like the way the shadow is captured on the railings... creates this sort of Y shape. I think this might have had even more impact in a larger size - appears a bit small on the page. Windmills make good Perspective/Leading Lines subjects :-)  I may have come in closer under the windmill to try and get it to loom above me more - but I would not have sacrificed the shadow effect.', '2007-12-24 02:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
