(4334212, 625007, 30982, '<td valign="top">Every once in awhile this site features a shot that is so pure, so wonderful that it reminds me why I keep trying, reminds me why photography, in addition to being a nice way to record time, is an art form.  This is one of those shots.  This both takes my breath away and nearly breaks my heart.  10</td>', 'Every once in awhile this site features a shot that is so pure, so wonderful that it reminds me why I keep trying, reminds me why photography, in addition to being a nice way to record time, is an art form.  This is one of those shots.  This both takes my breath away and nearly breaks my heart.  10', '2007-12-25 08:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4334213, 624823, 30982, '<td valign="top">Extremely apt entry for this challenge - very well thought out and executed.  The color against all that gray adds a wonderful touch of whimsy and fun.</td>', 'Extremely apt entry for this challenge - very well thought out and executed.  The color against all that gray adds a wonderful touch of whimsy and fun.', '2007-12-25 08:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
