(4334217, 624847, 30982, '<td valign="top">A very good photograph - wonderful tones.  A bit of sharpening ziggies on the strings, but hard to avoid at this size.  Not sure of the theme tie-in, other than the headles part maybe, but I do like the picture.</td>', 'A very good photograph - wonderful tones.  A bit of sharpening ziggies on the strings, but hard to avoid at this size.  Not sure of the theme tie-in, other than the headles part maybe, but I do like the picture.', '2007-12-25 09:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4334218, 625097, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would guess we''re looking down at a planter full of lovely poinsettias.  I think in this case to get more impact, you may have wanted to include more of the setting.  As presented, it''s nice and colorful but really doesn''t offer much more as far as composition to hold or engage the viewer.</td>', 'I would guess we''re looking down at a planter full of lovely poinsettias.  I think in this case to get more impact, you may have wanted to include more of the setting.  As presented, it''s nice and colorful but really doesn''t offer much more as far as composition to hold or engage the viewer.', '2007-12-25 09:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
