(4340622, 624731, 70514, '<td valign="top">A great hideaway find, not so sure about the colors on the land though.</td>', 'A great hideaway find, not so sure about the colors on the land though.', '2007-12-28 08:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340629, 625080, 70514, '<td valign="top">What a great capture.  I love the solitude and abandonment a little clip can provide.</td>', 'What a great capture.  I love the solitude and abandonment a little clip can provide.', '2007-12-28 08:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340636, 624585, 70514, '<td valign="top">I wish this was taken ON the street instead of the fire escape.  Might''ve had more impact and interest.</td>', 'I wish this was taken ON the street instead of the fire escape.  Might''ve had more impact and interest.', '2007-12-28 08:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340638, 624475, 70514, '<td valign="top">I love the processing, but am distracted by the two bits of red in this otherwise ethereal image.</td>', 'I love the processing, but am distracted by the two bits of red in this otherwise ethereal image.', '2007-12-28 08:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340642, 625089, 70514, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp.</td>', 'Nice and sharp.', '2007-12-28 08:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340644, 625028, 70514, '<td valign="top">Not an image of the arch I''m used to seeing, which is very cool.  I love the sky and the effect of light on just part of it.  Great processing.</td>', 'Not an image of the arch I''m used to seeing, which is very cool.  I love the sky and the effect of light on just part of it.  Great processing.', '2007-12-28 08:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340649, 624583, 70514, '<td valign="top">In one aspect, I think the three kids would make the image better by looking at the view instead of you, which gives it a snapshot feel. But the other I think just cropping them out would''ve worked better as well.  Still, a nice capture of the lighting and the beautiful blue sky.</td>', 'In one aspect, I think the three kids would make the image better by looking at the view instead of you, which gives it a snapshot feel. But the other I think just cropping them out would''ve worked better as well.  Still, a nice capture of the lighting and the beautiful blue sky.', '2007-12-28 08:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340650, 624973, 70514, '<td valign="top">Great processing on the train.  Really gives it character.</td>', 'Great processing on the train.  Really gives it character.', '2007-12-28 08:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4340656, 624913, 70514, '<td valign="top">Just wish there was a bit more contrast to this.</td>', 'Just wish there was a bit more contrast to this.', '2007-12-28 08:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
