(4340822, 624936, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s lovely.  I might''ve cropped it differently,but then it''d eliminate that neat strand of clouds. Never mind. ;~D 8</td>', 'That''s lovely.  I might''ve cropped it differently,but then it''d eliminate that neat strand of clouds. Never mind. ;~D 8', '2007-12-28 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
