(4340829, 624973, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great editing!!!  The clouds really make the shot but the colors on the train are great. Would make a cool postcard. ;~D</td>', 'Great editing!!!  The clouds really make the shot but the colors on the train are great. Would make a cool postcard. ;~D', '2007-12-28 10:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
