(4344522, 624620, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot, and a refreshing approach to this challenge. Definitely a view one does not normally see of the ''snow angel''. I like the centered comp, I think it works well here. Nice job on getting ''pure'' snow without any disturbances, footprints and what not. Even a great expression on the face. Nice job!</td>', 'Very cool shot, and a refreshing approach to this challenge. Definitely a view one does not normally see of the ''snow angel''. I like the centered comp, I think it works well here. Nice job on getting ''pure'' snow without any disturbances, footprints and what not. Even a great expression on the face. Nice job!', '2007-12-30 04:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
