(4346574, 624732, 85886, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the vertical line of the lights/signal that breaks the perspective line of the train that causes some viewer ''discomfort'', particularly because it''s in the central foreground.  It''s a lovely shot, but if I try to imagine the same shot with the lights but without half of the central pillar I think it would have been nicer.  Not saying you should clone it out or mess with it, just trying to help provide an explanation as to why it might not have been as well received as you expected.</td>', 'I think it''s the vertical line of the lights/signal that breaks the perspective line of the train that causes some viewer ''discomfort'', particularly because it''s in the central foreground.  It''s a lovely shot, but if I try to imagine the same shot with the lights but without half of the central pillar I think it would have been nicer.  Not saying you should clone it out or mess with it, just trying to help provide an explanation as to why it might not have been as well received as you expected.', '2007-12-31 01:16:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(4346575, 624885, 60862, '<td valign="top">Ah, I see we went similar directions.  Yours strikes me as more hopeful, though.  Very nice!</td>', 'Ah, I see we went similar directions.  Yours strikes me as more hopeful, though.  Very nice!', '2007-12-31 01:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4346577, 624374, 24454, '<td valign="top">OMG!  I can not believe this is in 22nd place!  It is so haunting and well done.. . hey, and I just looked down and noticed Juli used the same word: "haunting".   It really is beautiful.  I love it so much!</td>', 'OMG!  I can not believe this is in 22nd place!  It is so haunting and well done.. . hey, and I just looked down and noticed Juli used the same word: "haunting".   It really is beautiful.  I love it so much!', '2007-12-31 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4346588, 624354, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really like this, Jason. I like the composition, but most of all I like the light and colors -- the blues and yellows of the buildings echoed in the painting. And the black of the man''s coat balancing the black in the painting. I gave this a 9.<br/> <br/>P.S. If this were mine, I would remove the three bright things in the sidewalk.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-12-31 01:25:13.</i></td>', 'I really like this, Jason. I like the composition, but most of all I like the light and colors -- the blues and yellows of the buildings echoed in the painting. And the black of the man''s coat balancing the black in the painting. I gave this a 9. P.S. If this were mine, I would remove the three bright things in the sidewalk.', '2007-12-31 01:22:38.000000', '2007-12-31 01:25:13.000000', 0),
(4346590, 624833, 52549, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your blue ribbon, Andrew. It''s a stunning image, unusual and very creative.</td>', 'Congratulations on your blue ribbon, Andrew. It''s a stunning image, unusual and very creative.', '2007-12-31 01:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
