(4346617, 625007, 35274, '<td valign="top">There''s something very atmospheric about this image. I''m pleasantly surprised to see it in the top ten, as it''s not a very traditional "DPC" image, I think, but I still think it should have scored higher. Will hold a nice place in my favorites.</td>', 'There''s something very atmospheric about this image. I''m pleasantly surprised to see it in the top ten, as it''s not a very traditional "DPC" image, I think, but I still think it should have scored higher. Will hold a nice place in my favorites.', '2007-12-31 01:36:38.000000', NULL, 0),
