(4346677, 624885, 60915, '<td valign="top">Damn this is good, Don!<br/>Things don''t quite seem right here! <br/>The awkwardly twisted legs, the oversize jacket, no hands and face visible.<br/>Why has she been abandoned by the adult?<br/>Dang! I wish I could write like you to explain what I''m feeling about this shot... : )<br/></td>', 'Damn this is good, Don!Things don''t quite seem right here! The awkwardly twisted legs, the oversize jacket, no hands and face visible.Why has she been abandoned by the adult?Dang! I wish I could write like you to explain what I''m feeling about this shot... : )', '2007-12-31 02:53:24.000000', NULL, 0),
