(4347735, 624591, 1024, '<td valign="top">Unlike some of the other commenter''s, I like that the mirror does not fill the frame.  The fact that it is slightly off center really brings home the idea that it is a rear view mirror. I like the fish eye aspect of the image in the mirror. <br/> <br/>BTW, what a beautiful church!</td>', 'Unlike some of the other commenter''s, I like that the mirror does not fill the frame.  The fact that it is slightly off center really brings home the idea that it is a rear view mirror. I like the fish eye aspect of the image in the mirror.  BTW, what a beautiful church!', '2007-12-31 12:55:16.000000', NULL, 0),
